# Apple system services (Mac, Windows, Android, iOS)
# Local Apple services. ACL4SSR Apple.list is still loaded later, into this
# same group, so new upstream names are picked up. Its akadns.net line loses
# to Microsoft.list (loaded first). crashlytics.com and three non-Apple
# CIDRs are pinned to 漏网之鱼 before that upstream file.
#
# Dropped from upstream on purpose:
#   DOMAIN,apple.comscoreresearch.com  (glued token, NXDOMAIN, not a host)
#   DOMAIN-SUFFIX,crashlytics.com       (Firebase / Google, not Apple)
#   DOMAIN-SUFFIX,akadns.net            (Akamai zone; Clash matches the requested name)
#   IP-CIDR,205.180.175.0/24            (Level 3 / AS3356, not an Apple assignment)
#   IP-CIDR,192.35.50.0/24              (Claris corporate)
#   IP-CIDR,198.183.17.0/24             (Claris corporate)
#
# iOS cannot match PROCESS-NAME for other apps. Domain and IP-CIDR lines are
# what cover iPhone / iPad. Fake-IP mode does not consult no-resolve CIDRs
# until the connection already has a real destination IP.
#
# Mac system daemons (nsurlsessiond, trustd, apsd, Finder, Music, TV) are
# omitted. Their names are too broad; apple.com / icloud.com already cover them.

# Apple-owned suffixes (Apple enterprise host list + existing first-party zones)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,aaplimg.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apple-cloudkit.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apple-dns.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apple-livephotoskit.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apple-mapkit.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apzones.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cdn-apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,icloud-content.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,icloud.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,icloud.com.cn
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,itunes.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,me.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,mzstatic.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,shazam.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apple.co
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apple.com.cn
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,appstore.com

# Hosts outside apple.com. The .apple TLD is not matched by DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apple.com.
DOMAIN,token.safebrowsing.apple
DOMAIN,app-site-association.networking.apple
# Carrier-bundle host Apple documents as a connection target, not a CNAME-only name.
DOMAIN,appldnld.apple.com.edgesuite.net
# Apple CDN names that Microsoft.list would otherwise claim via akadns.net / edgesuite.net.
# The whole zones stay out of this file.
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,apple.com.akadns.net
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,cdn-apple.com.akadns.net
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,mzstatic.com.akadns.net
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,aaplimg.com.akadns.net
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,icloud.com.akadns.net
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,apple.com.edgesuite.net
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,mzstatic.com.edgesuite.net

# Windows iCloud / Devices / push. Streaming apps live in apple-media.list.
PROCESS-NAME,iTunes.exe
PROCESS-NAME,iCloud.exe
PROCESS-NAME,iCloudHome.exe
PROCESS-NAME,iCloudServices.exe
PROCESS-NAME,iCloudDrive.exe
PROCESS-NAME,iCloudPhotos.exe
PROCESS-NAME,APSDaemon.exe
PROCESS-NAME,AppleDevices.exe
PROCESS-NAME,AMPDevicesAgent.exe
PROCESS-NAME,com.shazam.android

# Apple-registered ranges. 139.178.128.0/17 and 144.178.0.0/18 replace the
# narrower upstream fragments that left announced Apple space uncovered.
IP-CIDR,17.0.0.0/8,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,63.92.224.0/19,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,65.199.22.0/23,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,139.178.128.0/17,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,144.178.0.0/18,no-resolve
IP-CIDR6,2403:300::/32,no-resolve
IP-CIDR6,2620:149::/32,no-resolve
IP-CIDR6,2a01:b740::/32,no-resolve
